            "text": "{\"findings\":[{\"tipo\":\"GPU\",\"causa_raiz\":\"O tempo de renderizacao da GPU atingiu 36.11ms contra o teto de 16.67ms (60 FPS), gerando 113 violacoes graves. O gargalo decorre de fillrate excessivo, sobreposicao de pixels translucidos (overdraw), resolucao nativa pesada para a GTX 1650 e shaders nao otimizados sem escalonamento dinamico de resolucao.\",\"codigo_refatorado\":\"using UnityEngine;\\\\nusing UnityEngine.Rendering;\\\\n\\\\n[DisallowMultipleComponent]\\\\npublic sealed class DynamicQualityOptimizer : MonoBehaviour\\\\n{\\\\n    [Header(\\\\\\\"GPU Throttle Control\\\\\\\")]\\\\n    [SerializeField] private float targetFrameTimeMs = 16.67f;\\\\n    [SerializeField] private float minDynamicScale = 0.65f;\\\\n    [SerializeField] private float maxDynamicScale = 1.0f;\\\\n    [SerializeField] private float scaleStep = 0.05f;\\\\n\\\\n    private float currentScale = 1.0f;\\\\n    private float frameAccumulator = 0f;\\\\n    private int frameCounter = 0;\\\\n    private const int EVALUATION_WINDOW = 30;\\\\n\\\\n    private void Awake()\\\\n    {\\\\n        QualitySettings.vSyncCount = 0;\\\\n        Application.targetFrameRate = 60;\\\\n        ScalableBufferManager.ResizeBuffers(maxDynamicScale, maxDynamicScale);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    private void Update()\\\\n    {\\\\n        frameAccumulator += Time.unscaledDeltaTime;\\\\n        frameCounter++;\\\\n\\\\n        if (frameCounter \u003c EVALUATION_WINDOW) return;\\\\n\\\\n        float avgFrameMs = (frameAccumulator / frameCounter) * 1000f;\\\\n        frameAccumulator = 0f;\\\\n        frameCounter = 0;\\\\n\\\\n        AdjustRenderScale(avgFrameMs);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    private void AdjustRenderScale(float avgFrameMs)\\\\n    {\\\\n        if (avgFrameMs \u003e targetFrameTimeMs && currentScale \u003e minDynamicScale)\\\\n        {\\\\n            currentScale = Mathf.Clamp(currentScale - scaleStep, minDynamicScale, maxDynamicScale);\\\\n            ScalableBufferManager.ResizeBuffers(currentScale, currentScale);\\\\n        }\\\\n        else if (avgFrameMs \u003c (targetFrameTimeMs * 0.85f) && currentScale \u003c maxDynamicScale)\\\\n        {\\\\n            currentScale = Mathf.Clamp(currentScale + scaleStep, minDynamicScale, maxDynamicScale);\\\\n            ScalableBufferManager.ResizeBuffers(currentScale, currentScale);\\\\n        }\\\\n    }\\\\n}\",\"explicacao_didatica\":\"A placa de video (GPU) esta demorando mais do que o dobro do tempo permitido para pintar cada frame na tela. O script refatorado monitora o tempo de quadro em blocos de 30 frames sem gerar lixo de memoria (GC) e aplica Dynamic Resolution Scaling. Se a GPU sofrer sobrecarga, a resolucao do buffer de renderizacao e reduzida suavemente, aliviando o fillrate da GTX 1650 e estabilizando a taxa em 60 FPS.\"},{\"tipo\":\"DrawCalls\",\"causa_raiz\":\"Pico de 2791 Draw Calls ultrapassando o orcamento estabelecido de 2579. Multiplos materiais unicos, falta de instanciamento por GPU (GPU Instancing) e objetos sem estaticidade configurada geram chamadas excessivas de desenho a CPU e GPU.\",\"codigo_refatorado\":\"using UnityEngine;\\\\n\\\\n[DisallowMultipleComponent]\\\\npublic sealed class StaticBatchOptimizer : MonoBehaviour\\\\n{\\\\n    [SerializeField] private Transform sceneStaticRoot;\\\\n\\\\n    private void Awake()\\\\n    {\\\\n        OptimizeStaticHierarchy();\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    private void OptimizeStaticHierarchy()\\\\n    {\\\\n        if (sceneStaticRoot == null)\\\\n        {\\\\n            sceneStaticRoot = transform;\\\\n        }\\\\n\\\\n        StaticBatchingUtility.Combine(sceneStaticRoot.gameObject);\\\\n    }\\\\n}\",\"explicacao_didatica\":\"Cada vez que a Unity precisa desenhar um modelo 3D diferente na tela com um material proprio, ela envia um 'Draw Call' para a placa de video. O script agrupa automaticamente objetos estaticos da cena em lotes combinados atraves de Static Batching, reduzindo drasticamente o numero de chamadas e diminuindo o estresse no pipeline de desenho.\"}],\"dicas_level_design\":\"O pico de 2791 Draw Calls e o tempo de 36.11ms de GPU exigem intervencao imediata em Level Design e Assets: 1) Ative e configure Occlusion Culling em todas as areas fechadas e corredores para que objetos fora da visao da camera nao sejam processados nem renderizados. 2) Crie e force LODs (Level of Detail) com transicoes agressivas de geometria e corte precoce (Cull) de aderecos pequenos em distancias medias. 3) Consolide texturas e materiais em Texture Atlases compartilhados para habilitar GPU Instancing nos materiais dos prefabs repetidos (como postes, vegetacao e caixas). 4) Limite a contagem e distancia de alcance de luzes em tempo real, priorizando iluminacao estatica pre-calculada (Baked Lightmaps) para aliviar o gargalo de pixel shading da GTX 1650.\"}",
